{"id":"bb305cc6af2d4262","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Bounded Forcing Axiom","display":"df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom — ZFC Forcing Bounded Forcing Axiom","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom","58-df-zfc-forcing8-bounded-forcing-axiom"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom — ZFC Forcing Bounded Forcing Axiom","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-boolean-completion-map]]","[[58-df-filter]]","[[../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing8-bounded-forcing-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-bounded-forcing-axiom — ZFC Forcing Bounded Forcing Axiom"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4faa581656027a13\" href=\"?note=4faa581656027a13\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-boolean-completion-map\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-boolean-completion-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fb7c32a0f0383968\" href=\"?note=fb7c32a0f0383968\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain\">../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\Gamma(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (metatheoretic class predicate on forcing posets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal bound)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B},e\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B},e\\in V\\)</span> (forcing and explicit Boolean-completion data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbb B}^+\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in(\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0_{\\mathbb B}\\})\\times(\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0_{\\mathbb B}\\}):a\\wedge b=a\\}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbb B}^+\\coloneqq\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in(\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0_{\\mathbb B}\\})\\times(\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0_{\\mathbb B}\\}):a\\wedge b=a\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBooleanCompletionMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBooleanCompletionMap}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit completion-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4faa581656027a13\" href=\"?note=4faa581656027a13\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-boolean-completion-map\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-boolean-completion-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S\\)</span> (maximal-antichain predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fb7c32a0f0383968\" href=\"?note=fb7c32a0f0383968\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain\">../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\)</span> (forcing-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBoundedForcingAxiom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBoundedForcingAxiom}_S\\)</span> (bounded-forcing-axiom predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8BoundedForcingAxiom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8BoundedForcingAxiom}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBoundedForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall P,\\leq_P\\;\\Bigl(\\Gamma(P,\\leq_P)\\to\n\\forall\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B},e\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBooleanCompletionMap}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\\to\n\\forall\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\n|\\mathcal A|\\leq\\kappa\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0_{\\mathbb B}\\},\\leq_{\\mathbb B}^+)\\land|A|\\leq\\kappa)\n\\to\\exists G\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0_{\\mathbb B}\\},\\leq_{\\mathbb B}^+)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(G\\cap A\\neq\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBoundedForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall P,\\leq_P\\;\\Bigl(\\Gamma(P,\\leq_P)\\to\n\\forall\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B},e\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBooleanCompletionMap}_S(e,P,\\leq_P,\\mathbb B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0_{\\mathbb B},1_{\\mathbb B})\\to\n\\forall\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\n|\\mathcal A|\\leq\\kappa\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(\\mathrm{MaxAntichain}_S(A,\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0_{\\mathbb B}\\},\\leq_{\\mathbb B}^+)\\land|A|\\leq\\kappa)\n\\to\\exists G\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,\\mathbb B\\setminus\\{0_{\\mathbb B}\\},\\leq_{\\mathbb B}^+)\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(G\\cap A\\neq\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}alias}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8BoundedForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBoundedForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}bounded\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}alias}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8BoundedForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBoundedForcingAxiom}_S(\\Gamma,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>This is a metatheoretic scheme in the class predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>. Boolean operations, zero, both forcing orders, the dense completion map, and maximal-antichain predicate are all explicit and use their exact upstream signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-boolean-completion-map","status":"resolved","id":"4faa581656027a13","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-boolean-completion-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain","status":"resolved","id":"fb7c32a0f0383968","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-boolean-completion-map","status":"resolved","id":"4faa581656027a13","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcingBooleanCompletionMap}_S$ (fully explicit completion-map predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-boolean-completion-map]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-maximal-antichain","status":"resolved","id":"fb7c32a0f0383